---
title: "Which door can you actually walk?"
description: "Five questions. Not a lecture about 20%. I'll tell you which deposit path is real this year, and which ones are closed."
layout: base.njk
permalink: /which-door/
date: 2026-08-20
---

{% set doorSvg %}
<svg class="quiz-door-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <path d="M5 30V12.2A7 7 0 0 1 12 6a7 7 0 0 1 7 6.2V30"/>
  <path d="M4 30h16"/>
  <circle cx="15.3" cy="19" r="1.15" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
</svg>
{% endset %}

{% block schema %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebApplication",
  "name": "Which door can you actually walk?",
  "description": "{{ description }}",
  "url": "https://wombathomeloans.com.au/which-door/",
  "applicationCategory": "FinanceApplication",
  "operatingSystem": "Web",
  "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "AUD" },
  "provider": { "@type": "MortgageBroker", "name": "Wombat Home Loans", "url": "https://wombathomeloans.com.au/" }
}
</script>
{% endblock %}

<section class="section section--tight quiz-hero">
  <div class="quiz-hero__doors" aria-hidden="true">
    {{ doorSvg | safe }}
    {{ doorSvg | safe }}
    {{ doorSvg | safe }}
    {{ doorSvg | safe }}
    {{ doorSvg | safe }}
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="calc-breadcrumb"><a href="/calculators/">← All calculators</a></p>
    <span class="eyebrow">Deposit paths</span>
    <h1>Which door can you <em>actually walk?</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Five questions. I will tell you which deposit path is worth walking this year.</p>
    <p>The government 5% first-home scheme. An occupation LMI waiver at about 90%. Shared-equity or a borrowed-deposit second loan. Or a standard 20% deposit loan if you already have it.</p>
    <p>This is not an approval. It is the same order I walk in a strategy session.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight" data-calc="whichdoor">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="calc-grid">

      <form class="calc-card calc-panel quiz-form" id="wd-form" novalidate>
        <div class="quiz-form__band">
          <p class="quiz-form__band-kicker">Five questions</p>
          <div class="quiz-progress" id="wd-progress" style="--wd-done: 0;">
            <div class="quiz-progress__bar" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="5" aria-valuenow="0" aria-labelledby="wd-progress-meta" id="wd-progress-bar">
              <span class="quiz-progress__bar-fill"></span>
            </div>
            <ol class="quiz-progress__steps">
              <li class="quiz-progress__step is-now" data-step="firstHome">
                <span class="quiz-progress__mark">{{ doorSvg | safe }}</span>
                <span class="quiz-progress__num">1</span>
              </li>
              <li class="quiz-progress__step" data-step="location">
                <span class="quiz-progress__mark">{{ doorSvg | safe }}</span>
                <span class="quiz-progress__num">2</span>
              </li>
              <li class="quiz-progress__step" data-step="price">
                <span class="quiz-progress__mark">{{ doorSvg | safe }}</span>
                <span class="quiz-progress__num">3</span>
              </li>
              <li class="quiz-progress__step" data-step="cash">
                <span class="quiz-progress__mark">{{ doorSvg | safe }}</span>
                <span class="quiz-progress__num">4</span>
              </li>
              <li class="quiz-progress__step" data-step="waiver">
                <span class="quiz-progress__mark">{{ doorSvg | safe }}</span>
                <span class="quiz-progress__num">5</span>
              </li>
            </ol>
            <p class="quiz-progress__meta" id="wd-progress-meta"><span id="wd-progress-count">0</span> of 5 answered</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quiz-form__body">
        <fieldset class="quiz-q">
          <legend class="quiz-q__legend"><span class="quiz-q__num">1</span> Are you a first-home buyer in Australia?</legend>
          <div class="quiz-options">
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="firstHome" value="yes">
              <span>Yes, first home here</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="firstHome" value="owned">
              <span>I have owned in Australia before</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="firstHome" value="unsure">
              <span>Not sure</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="quiz-q">
          <legend class="quiz-q__legend"><span class="quiz-q__num">2</span> Where is the property?</legend>
          <div class="quiz-options">
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="location" value="sydney">
              <span>Sydney, Illawarra, Newcastle or Lake Macquarie</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="location" value="nsw">
              <span>Other NSW</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="location" value="other">
              <span>Another state or territory</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="location" value="unsure">
              <span>Not sure yet</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="quiz-q">
          <legend class="quiz-q__legend"><span class="quiz-q__num">3</span> Rough purchase price?</legend>
          <div class="quiz-options">
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="price" value="under800">
              <span>Under $800,000</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="price" value="mid">
              <span>$800,000 to $1,500,000</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="price" value="over1500">
              <span>Over $1,500,000</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="price" value="unsure">
              <span>Not sure yet</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="quiz-q">
          <legend class="quiz-q__legend"><span class="quiz-q__num">4</span> Cash you can actually use as a deposit THIS year? (Not locked KiwiSaver. Not equity you cannot access.)</legend>
          <div class="quiz-options">
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="cash" value="under3">
              <span>Under 3% of the price</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="cash" value="about5">
              <span>About 5%</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="cash" value="about10">
              <span>About 10%</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="cash" value="about20">
              <span>20% or more</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="cash" value="unsure">
              <span>Not sure</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="quiz-q">
          <legend class="quiz-q__legend"><span class="quiz-q__num">5</span> Could a lender waive LMI because of your job? (Bank or financial institution, or a listed profession such as doctor, lawyer, accountant. If you do not know, say so.)</legend>
          <div class="quiz-options">
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="waiver" value="yes">
              <span>Yes, probably</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="waiver" value="no">
              <span>No</span>
            </label>
            <label class="quiz-option">
              <input type="radio" name="waiver" value="unsure">
              <span>I do not know</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="quiz-actions">
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" type="submit" id="wd-submit" disabled>See result</button>
          <p class="calc-field__hint" id="wd-need-all">Pick an answer for each question. Not sure is a real answer.</p>
        </div>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div class="stack-lg">
        <div class="calc-card quiz-result-card" id="wd-result-card">
          <div id="wd-empty" class="quiz-empty">
            <div class="quiz-empty__doors" aria-hidden="true">
              {{ doorSvg | safe }}
              {{ doorSvg | safe }}
              {{ doorSvg | safe }}
              {{ doorSvg | safe }}
              {{ doorSvg | safe }}
            </div>
            <span class="quiz-empty__kicker">Your door</span>
            <p class="quiz-empty__title">Answer five. Get one door.</p>
            <p class="quiz-empty__note">I will name the path that is worth walking, and the ones that look closed. No email. No sales sequence.</p>
          </div>

          <div id="wd-result" class="quiz-result" hidden aria-live="polite">
            <div class="quiz-result__stage">
              <div class="quiz-result__art" aria-hidden="true">{{ doorSvg | safe }}</div>
              <p class="quiz-result__kicker" id="wd-kicker">Walk this</p>
              <p class="quiz-result__stamp" id="wd-headline"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="quiz-result__body">
              <div class="quiz-copy" id="wd-copy"></div>
              <div class="quiz-doors" id="wd-doors" aria-label="Other doors"></div>
              <div class="quiz-cta">
                {% cta "Book a free discovery call" %}
                <p class="calc-field__hint">Thirty minutes on Google Meet. I will tell you if this door is actually open, including not yet.</p>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" id="wd-reset">Start again</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="calc-assumptions" data-reveal>
      <details>
        <summary>Assumptions behind this tool</summary>
        <ul>
          <li>This walks the same order I use in a strategy session: 20% first, then an occupation LMI waiver at about 90%, then the government 5% first-home scheme, then shared-equity or a borrowed-deposit second loan. It is a path-finder, not a credit assessment.</li>
          <li>Housing Australia price caps used here (from 1 October 2025, still the current published NSW figures in 2026): $1,500,000 for Sydney, Illawarra, Newcastle and Lake Macquarie; $800,000 for the rest of NSW. Other states have their own caps. Confirm the live postcode cap on <a href="https://www.housingaustralia.gov.au/support-buy-home/property-price-caps" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Housing Australia</a>.</li>
          <li>Cash means money you can actually use as a deposit this year. Locked KiwiSaver and equity you cannot access do not count.</li>
          <li>An LMI waiver depends on that lender’s occupation list on the day. “Yes, probably” is not a guarantee.</li>
          <li>Product features change. This is general information, not personal advice.</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "calc-cta.njk" %}

<section class="section section--tight" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="calc-disclaimer">
      Product features change. Confirm live scheme caps on
      <a href="https://www.housingaustralia.gov.au/support-buy-home/property-price-caps" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Housing Australia</a>.
      This is not personal advice.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% block scripts %}
<script src="/assets/js/which-door.js?v=20260821b" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
